{"id":9530846958,"name":"EPSILON LINEAGE 2","desc":"Epsilon Lineage is a Rogue Lineage edit/spinoff that introduces new classes, races, artifacts, locations, dungeons, and lore pieces. Certain aspects of the game have been overhauled, including a complete map redesign and numerous class/race reworks, however much of the core game mechanics remain unchanged. \n\nExplore a new yet familiar world, featuring: \n- Accelerated Progression \n- 10 New Super Classes \n- 16 New Ultra Classes \n- 10+ New Artifacts \n- Blessings\n- New Cosmetic Items: Vanity Armor, Accessories, Skins, and more! \n\nGame info and update logs can be found in the #update-logs and #links channels in the community server, including the official Trello/wiki for the game. \n\nPremium players receive Insight, Silver, and a Life every hour.","path":"/game/9530846958-epsilon-lineage-2","slug":"9530846958-epsilon-lineage-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f985df5e196e7c11db28bb1d967cff0b5a83f13e7c6d2d7d5536e928a4152dcb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-058c67a38be53d55774d105a76b9ba9e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":3791913,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-11T11:36:44.367Z","creator":{"name":"joe's group lol","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":2},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"EPSILON-LINEAGE-2-BillsTheGod-GUI-5674","_id":"631dc84cd3c397dd346b0ec9","title":"BillsTheGod GUI","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c788ab","gameId":9530846958,"name":"EPSILON LINEAGE 2","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":9530846958},"features":"Features:\n- Knock Yourself: Allows you to knock yourself out instead of waiting for another player to do it for you.\n- Auto Pickup: Automatically picks up any trinkets that are within range.\n- Instant Log: Immediately log you from the game if you're not in danger.\n- Spectate Players: Allows you to spectate other players in the game.\n- Remove Kill Bricks: Remove all kill bricks from the game so you don't have to worry about it.\n- No Fall Damage: You will not take fall damage no matter how high you fall.\n- No Sun Check: You will not be affected by the sun no matter how long you stay in its light.\n- No Dash Cooldown: You can dash infinitely without any cooldown.\n- No Fog: Disable all fog from the game.\n- Fullbright: Maximizes the brightness of the game.\n- Change Armor Dye: Changes the color of your armor.\n- Change Mana Color: Changes the color of your mana.\n- Trinket & Kingdom of Ceeris ESP: Allows you to see trinkets and the kingdom of Ceeris even if they are not in your line of sight.\n- Staff Notification: Notifies you whenever a staff member enters the game.\n- Lobisomem Pidão: pede pede que so a porra enche o saco esse bicho pidão (I hope you have google translator at your disposal when HE appears)\n--[[\n    Changelog: (v1.0.1b) | 07/22/2022\n        - Added 'Change Armor Dye' & 'Change Mana Color'\n        - Added 'Lobisome Pidão' (pede pede que so a porra)\n\n    Changelog: (v1.0.1) | 07/17/2022\n        - Added 'No Dash Cooldown'\n        - Added 'Instant Log'\n        - Added 'Spectate Player'\n\n        - Fixed 'Remove Kill Bricks' not working correctly in some scenarios\n        - The Trinkets ESP will now show all Phoenix Downs, doesn't matter if you're close to it or not\n        - Fixed staff notification not showing when they leave the server\n        - Staff notification will now show their rank\n        - Max distance for the ESPs has been lowered (Trinkets: 750 -> 150 | Ceeris: 2500 -> 1000)\n        - Changed all sections icon to match with their purpose\n\n        - Trinkets ESP will now load all existing trinkets when you execute the script\n        - Organized some script code\n\n    Changelog: (v1.0.0) | 07/14/2022\n        - Release of the script\n]]\n\nThread: https://v3rmillion.net/s